OL,3,ASeven planes searched after suspected
OL,4,Abomb threats across Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plane that departed Manchester was
OL,7,Finspected in Murcia, where a local
OL,8,Fofficial said no explosives were found
OL,10,FOn Monday, a flight from London Luton
OL,11,Fto Sofia made an emergency landing in
OL,12,FBudapest, following a bomb threat
